        "id": 161180,
        "name": "ketigid",
        "username": "ketigid",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9fc29f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-08T04:11:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I don't want to start a new thread, so I'll post here instead.</p><p>I recalled the reason for officially printing Cleverest Legacy was given something along the line of \"Every Legacy promo is a different person\".</p><p>However, with the latest 1million Freedom Five stretch goal on Kickstarter, this is no longer true. The \"current Legacy\" is represented twice.</p><p>So, I guess it's alright to print Cleverst Legacy as an official promo now, right, right?</p>",
